==Restrictions==
Cat Deploy Cost: Only 300¢ or more

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 5.33~16.67 seconds<sup>160f~500f</sup>.
*10 [[Shibalien]]s (200%) spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 4~16 seconds<sup>120f~480f</sup>.
*10 [[Shibalien]]s (400%) spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 4~16 seconds<sup>120f~480f</sup>.
*10 [[Shibalien]]s (600%) spawn after 166.67 seconds<sup>5,000f</sup>, delay 4~16 seconds<sup>120f~480f</sup>.
*10 [[Shibalien]]s (800%) spawn after 213.33 seconds<sup>6,400f</sup>, delay 4~16 seconds<sup>120f~480f</sup>.
*10 [[Shibalien]]s (1,000%) spawn after 280 seconds<sup>8,400f</sup>, delay 4~16 seconds<sup>120f~480f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shibalien]]s (1,200%) spawn after 360 seconds<sup>10,800f</sup>, delay 0.07~6 seconds<sup>2f~180f</sup>.
*1 [[Cosmic Cyclone]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Just use the same strategy you used in [[Black Hole Rising (Insane)|Black Hole Rising]], but with meatshields that cost at least 300¢, such as [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Rover Cat Mk II]] or [[Sumo Cat (Special Cat)|Riceball Cat]].

